    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've been documenting stuff but it feels like they're ahead of me. every time i fix one thing, they find a new way to poke holes in my account. i need to be more proactive before they finish what they're doing. what kind of defensive maneuvers can i use to protect my funds and stop them from liquidating my account? i need to stay one step ahead of them.",
