      "content": "Your proactive stance is the best defense against these predatory tactics; you are right to be vigilant. To stay ahead, immediately look into opening an account at a different, fully vetted financial institution as a backup. Furthermore, you can proactively request a detailed, itemized breakdown of *every* fee charged, citing your rights as a customer. Keeping your funds diversified across multiple, secure institutions will ensure that if one account is targeted, your entire financial security remains intact.",
